      "generatedCopy": "Cloudflare Agents SDK 0.33 changes how Pi sessions persist streamed progress. This checklist covers restart tests, session compatibility, and planning a repair release when older runtimes cannot read new sessions.\n\nhttps://indieseek.co/blogs/cloudflare-agents-sdk-0-33-pi-1-5-roll-forward-persistence-checklist/?utm_source=mastodon",
