      "generatedCopy": "Cloudflare Agents SDK 0.33.0 moves PiHarness to Pi 1.5—but once a conversation is written in the new format, Pi 1.4 cannot read it.\n\nBefore rollout, inventory removed APIs, measure the persistWithinMs crash-loss window, migrate session.events() to session.watch(), and keep a Pi 1.5-compatible repair release ready.\n\nThe practical roll-forward checklist:",
